{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（19日）下午4時39分，據報3名男子騎單車由西沙GO PARK出發，擬前往深涌營地；途至深涌碼頭附近時，其中一名姓戴（71歲）老翁，懷疑暈倒從單車跌下，不省人事。</p><p>政府飛行服務隊派出直升機，協助將事主送往東區醫院搶救，情況危殆。醫院可見，事主須戴上氧氣罩、左邊眼角有傷。據了解，戴翁有身體病患紀錄；警方現正調查事件。</p><figure><img alt=\"男事主抵院時需戴上氧氣罩。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200150867584487424832567.jpeg/WoYHdNUEbJNYqtQhfZPYd0a76OxB1AYJLAFQxjoBUMY\"/><figcaption>男事主抵院時需戴上氧氣罩。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男事主抵院時需戴上氧氣罩。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200150918260068352897361.jpeg/jSQxO3s_PDZ8iZQW2aYg1FoT-Ej7eQ0RtGmel6Jpnpc\"/><figcaption>男事主抵院時需戴上氧氣罩。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男事主抵院時需戴上氧氣罩，左眼角有傷。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200155294693330944836704.jpeg/HcKh5SWon40vvoRDWY_69W2Twac4zi3ELkOFwgdDhcI\"/><figcaption>男事主抵院時需戴上氧氣罩，左眼角有傷。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男事主抵院時需戴上氧氣罩。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200151010794803200541920.jpeg/d5KdxwUji4I6QYSG45o2qP3JSf-miEYpL5z0Jzmc9Cc\"/><figcaption>男事主抵院時需戴上氧氣罩。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T22:44:20.124969+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":247,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T10:33:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T22:37:55.752179+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T22:37:55.752179+00:00","content_hash":"45143c47bcdc7b2296f23e3321c6338eb3054007e4435856c6b4e235af7025f1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}